{"title":"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the figure, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/1/7b1ac662f7ddbbce489953c8b7693848239564aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"28\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/1/2918f7d23f9ee8c04baabad86100d68023ec03f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/5/4056d41f42aa8a00adca0ff5d1209b6bb0e92d6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle C$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> are right angles.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/c/f6c2288a86e6a0b3344fae250746b4ec887fa865.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AEB = 40^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"104\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/c/40c995f36fe8d2c6595764eb6cc53f903f8247bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BED = \\angle BDE$\" width=\"139\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/4/c640ab951cf8331c82de1b47cf0a6ef351c114fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CDE =$\" width=\"75\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/6/ac6cb7b3dc91e264fcd05ead4b80a3040983193a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] dot((0,0)); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,(0,0),SW); dot(dir(85)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,dir(85),NW); dot((4,0)); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,(4,0),SE); dot((4.05677,0.648898)); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,(4.05677,0.648898),NE); draw((0,0)--dir(85)--(4.05677,0.648898)--(4,0)--cycle);  dot((2,2)); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,(2,2),N); draw((0,0)--(2,2)--(4,0)); pair [] x = intersectionpoints((0,0)--(2,2)--(4,0),dir(85)--(4.05677,0.648898)); dot(x[0]); dot(x[1]); label(&quot;$F$&quot;,x[0],SE); label(&quot;$G$&quot;,x[1],SW); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"145\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c613b4c9f92aa908fbe7452cd14c1fe53d8439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 75^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 80^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 85^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 90^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 95^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"412\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/5/7c5337c8bdf35fc411887b8a9a81892381e2c1a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BED=\\angle BDE$\" width=\"139\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/d/92d94bb833169745b3dc4dd65154e835e0cd9a35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle B=90^\\circ$\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/0/f007680c47a068a3aef3f4c57e9484da78281a63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BED$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> is a triangle, we get: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/e/62e075dcad55a9dafa98d27429ec82bef07bdcdc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle B + \\angle BED +\\angle BDE=180\\]\" width=\"237\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/6/2d61974fafa0ed7ec9536762b09b3c2ee7054371.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[90 +\\angle BED +\\angle BED=180\\]\" width=\"228\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/b/69b73ab0d53de622cb597f331e474a599d8d2e6d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2\\angle BED=90\\]\" width=\"108\" height=\"12\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/8/1689d50da9c439c501d1815fee12c82a2e0070c3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle BED=\\angle BDE=45^\\circ\\]\" width=\"187\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/c/93c5dd64ecf407bd950413a73fd4efd5b787ba83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AED=\\angle AEB +\\angle BED=40 +45=85^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"347\" height=\"14\" /> Since ACDE is a quadrilateral, the sum of its angles is 360. Therefore: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c685498b043b47366837794a68bd06afe669d955.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle A +\\angle C +\\angle CDE +\\angle AED=360\\]\" width=\"284\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/9/df9fa306c78a56a0e32801cb1792ff092c5940a0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[90 +90 +\\angle CDE +85=360\\]\" width=\"228\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/b/f7b864b78002f0d20ef2dcf1445d315528094c1c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle CDE=95^\\circ \\text{(E)}\\]\" width=\"130\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME\" title=\"1995 AJHSME\">1995 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problem